&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;A quick search for &lt;code&gt;fastlane +&amp;quot;An exception has occurred: issuerId is required&amp;quot;&lt;/code&gt; led me to this issue on GitHub:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class="link" href="https://github.com/fastlane/fastlane/issues/20741" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
&gt; [pilot] fails to upload build to TestFlight using api key after iTMSTransporter auto updated to version 3.0.0 with An exception has occurred: issuerId is required error&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;One particular &lt;a class="link" href="https://github.com/fastlane/fastlane/issues/20741#issuecomment-1285291626" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
&gt;comment by Tobias Totzek&lt;/a&gt; provided the exact answer to my problem. I changed the Agent Specification from &lt;code&gt;macos-latest&lt;/code&gt; to &lt;code&gt;macOS-12&lt;/code&gt; and problem solved.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Credits:&lt;br&gt;
&lt;a class="link" href="https://github.com/honkmaster" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
&gt;Tobias Totzek&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>